        <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, height: 62, paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: 'rgba(231,129,114,0.035)', border: '1px solid rgba(231,129,114,0.22)', borderRadius: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 30, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.52)' }}>30</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 54, paddingTop: 3, paddingBottom: 3, alignItems: 'center', background: 'rgba(231,129,114,0.10)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172' }}>DENY</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginLeft: 10, width: 250 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.86)' }}>办公区 → 数据库区</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.48)' }}>ANY · 永远到不了</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 14, paddingLeft: 12, borderLeft: '2px solid #6BC8D1' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                第 1 条命中即停止；第 30 条的拒绝不会被检查。<br />规则的“位置”，本身就是策略的一部分。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 536, top: 140, width: 688 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 42, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>01</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 630 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>规则可编辑</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>新增、删除、上移、下移、启停；来源与目标支持 ANY / ZONE / NODE 三种粒度。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 42, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>02</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 630 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>判定可追溯</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>通信 → Firewall → 规则 → 结果；命中规则、阻断位置与前后状态都写进事件。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 42, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 630 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>失效可感知</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>拓扑、策略或安全控制一变，上一轮结果立即标记过期；只改布局不会误触发。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', height: 78, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)', borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(242,247,248,0.10)' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 42, marginTop: 12, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 10, color: '#6BC8D1' }}>04</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 630 }}>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F2F7F8' }}>默认拒绝</Text>
                <Text style={{ marginTop: 3, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.54)', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>没有规则命中时使用本机 Default Policy；系统不提供“默认放行”的捷径。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, padding: 16, background: 'rgba(107,200,209,0.055)', borderLeft: '2px solid #6BC8D1' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.88)', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                不是规则越多越安全，<br />而是顺序与作用域共同决定结果。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

